   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2,500eb (Very Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>I</strong>nstall: Hospital</p>\n<p><strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 7 (2d6)</p>\n<p><em>Have you ever wondered what it would be like if you had emergency blast shutters, but in your own body? Of course you haven't, that would be stupid. But you can buy them anyways!</em></p>\n<p>External Body Cyberware. Once per 24 hours, when the user is reduced to the Seriously or Mortally Wounded Wound State, this cyberware activates automatically. Until the end of the user’s next Turn, any incoming damage (after armor) is reduced by 2. Armor is still ablated. Only one Scar Coalescer may be installed at a time.</p>\n<p><strong>Type:</strong> External Body Cyberware<br>\n<strong>Install:</strong> Hospital<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> uses 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
